/* Mylo — Supabase-backed rooms, goals, calendar, chat */

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   Pre-launch scope
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   What has a way in. Nothing here deletes code and nothing here touches the
   database: every balance, ledger row and purchase keeps being read, reduced
   and stored exactly as before, so turning a flag back on restores the
   feature with its history intact.

   The rule for a hidden feature is that it leaves no trace in the interface —
   no dead button, no empty tab, no heading over nothing — and that a route,
   deep link or old notification pointing at it lands on Today rather than on
   a blank screen.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
